					"content": "還有別的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411300502
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411300502,
					"content": "哦…好吧。沒關係，我再尋思一下怎麼對付那些魔物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
